'''Crazed Cat''' (狂乱のネコ ''Kyōran no Neko'', '''Frenzy Cat''') is an enemy that appears in [[Dark Souls (Insane)|The Crazed Cat]], where he can be unlocked as a [[Crazed Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Cat Unit]], as well as [[Clan of the Maniacs]] and [[Heavenly Tower/Floor 31|Floor 31]] of the [[Heavenly Tower]]. It was added in [[Version 2.2 Update#Version 2.2.3 Update|Version 2.2.3]].

