==Enemy==
This enemy has massive health, high DPS and non-stop Area Attacks. His only weaknesses are his somewhat low range and movement speed, so try to use those to your advantage.

==Strategy==
In [[Dark Souls (Insane)]], the best strategy is to stack [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]] and/or similar [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rares]] at the beginning of the level. Cheaper stackable attackers like [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]] will help greatly against him. Make sure to bring at least three meatshields, such as [[Cat (Normal Cat)|Macho Cat]], [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Wall Cat]] and [[Boogie Cat (Special Cat)|Boogie Cat]]. Using [[Battle Items#Sniper the Cat|Sniper the Cat]] is also recommended to keep him at bay if you are struggling; otherwise, [[Sniper the Recruit (Super Rare Cat)|Sniper the Recruit]] could be used instead if you have it. It is highly recommended to have all Empire of Cats superior treasures before attempting this stage.

